@startuml 02_Auth_With_Other_Device

title 02. User Authenticate - With Other Device (QR Code Transfer)

actor User
participant "New Device\nClient" as NewClient
participant "New Device\nStorage" as NewStorage
participant "Old Device\nClient" as OldClient
participant "Old Device\nStorage" as OldStorage
participant "Server API" as Server

User -> NewClient: Login (email, password)
activate NewClient

NewClient -> Server: POST /auth/login\n{email, password}
activate Server
Server --> NewClient: 200 OK\n{session_token}
deactivate Server

NewClient -> NewStorage: Check for identity_secret
activate NewStorage
NewStorage --> NewClient: NOT FOUND
deactivate NewStorage

NewClient --> User: "Identity secret not found\nUse another device?"
deactivate NewClient

User -> NewClient: "Yes, I have another device"
activate NewClient

NewClient --> User: Display QR scan prompt
deactivate NewClient

User -> OldClient: "Transfer identity to new device"
activate OldClient

OldClient -> OldStorage: Retrieve identity_secret
activate OldStorage
OldStorage --> OldClient: identity_secret
deactivate OldStorage

OldClient -> OldClient: Generate QR code\nPayload: {identity_secret, timestamp}
note right of OldClient
  QR code contains:
  - identity_secret (encrypted)
  - timestamp
  - signature
  
  Transfer happens OFFLINE
  via QR scan - no server
end note

OldClient --> User: Display QR code
deactivate OldClient

User -> User: Scan QR code with new device

User -> NewClient: QR scanned
activate NewClient

NewClient -> NewClient: Parse QR payload
NewClient -> NewClient: Verify timestamp\n(prevent replay)
NewClient -> NewClient: Verify signature

NewClient -> NewStorage: Store identity_secret
activate NewStorage
NewStorage --> NewClient: Stored
deactivate NewStorage

NewClient --> User: "Identity transferred successfully"
deactivate NewClient

note over User, Server
  Transfer complete:
  ✅ Identity secret moved to new device
  ✅ Transfer happened offline (QR code)
  ❌ Server never involved in transfer
  ✅ Both devices now have same identity_secret
end note

@enduml
